# Intrinsic spin Nernst effect of magnons in a noncollinear antiferromagnet

**Bo Li, Shane Sandhoefner, Alexey A. Kovalev** — Univ. of Nebraska, Lincoln
arXiv:1907.10567v3 [cond-mat.mes-hall] 24 Oct 2019

